--- Responsive Layout Verification ---
The Ecommerce frontend uses:
  - Tailwind CSS v3.4.19 with responsive breakpoints
  - react-responsive v10.0.1 for viewport-aware rendering
  - Vite dev server for local testing

Viewports tested via browser DevTools responsive mode:
  - Desktop 1920x1080 (Chrome): Layout renders correctly, navigation functional
  - Desktop 1440x900 (Chrome):  Layout scales, no overflow issues
  - Tablet 768x1024 (iPad):     Grid collapses to 2 columns, nav hamburger works
  - Mobile 375x812 (iPhone X):  Single column layout, touch targets sized correctly
  - Mobile 360x640 (Android):   Equivalent layout to iPhone, no horizontal scroll

--- Browser Compatibility ---
Browsers tested (manual via local dev server):
  - Chrome 115+ (Desktop, Windows): Full functionality verified
  - Edge (Chromium, Windows):        Full functionality verified

--- Key UI Flows Verified ---
1. Product listing page loads with images, prices, and responsive grid
2. Product detail page displays add-on selectors (fall/in-skirt)
3. Cart page updates totals on quantity change
4. Checkout flow renders address selection and order summary
5. Navigation between pages works without console errors

